# Mission: Fix release CI build failures (v3.1.0)

CI failed on 3/4 build jobs for tag v3.1.0 (run 31638036996, commit 29d40bd).
Windows build PASSED. Verified root causes from CI logs + local reproduction:

1. macOS (x86_64 + aarch64): `vite build` JavaScript heap OOM (exit 134) - Node default
   ~2GB heap exhausted by full Monaco bundle (monaco chunk 4MB min + 7MB ts.worker).
   Reproduced locally: NODE_OPTIONS=--max-old-space-size=2048 -> crash; 4096/8192 -> pass.
2. Ubuntu: `failed to bundle project http status: 503` - transient GitHub 503 while
   bundler downloaded AppImage tooling (frontend + Rust compiled fine).

## M1: Fix workflow heap limit | status: in_progress
